## 11. Complete API endpoint table

| # | Method | Endpoint | Purpose | Where called |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `GET` | `/api/notifications` | Fetch all notifications (on mount + every 20s) | `App.tsx → fetchNotifications()` |
| 2 | `GET` | `/api/notifications` | Pagination / load more | `App.tsx → loadMoreNotifications()` |
| 3 | `PATCH` | `/api/notifications` | Mark **all** as read | `App.tsx → markAllNotificationsAsRead()` |
| 4 | `POST` | `/api/notifications/{id}/read` | Mark **one** as read | `App.tsx → openNotificationTarget().markAsRead()` |
| 5 | `DELETE` | `/api/notifications?id={id}` | Delete one notification | `App.tsx → deleteNotification()` |
| 6 | `PUT` | `/api/group-invites?id={inviteId}&group_id={groupId}` | **Accept** group invite | `App.tsx → acceptGroupInvite()` (+ fallbacks in both components) |
| 7 | `PUT` | `/api/group-invites?id={inviteId}&group_id={groupId}` | **Decline** group invite | `App.tsx → declineGroupInvite()` (+ fallbacks in both components) |
| 8 | `POST` | `/api/groups/{groupId}/join` | Fallback join (NotificationsPage only) | `NotificationsPage.tsx` when `onAcceptGroupInvite` is missing |

