## 14. Behavior summary

| User action | What happens |
|---|---|
| **Open the notification panel** | Renders the `notifications` prop as-is. No fetch. |
| **Click a notification** | Calls `onNotificationClick(n)` / `onOpenNotification(n)`. Parent handles navigation + `POST /api/notifications/{id}/read`. Locally marks `is_read` for instant UI. |
| **Click "Mark all read"** | Optimistic `is_read = 1` on all rows. Calls `onMarkAllRead()` / `onMarkAllAsRead()`. Parent fires `PATCH /api/notifications`. Rolls back on error. |
| **Click "See previous notifications"** | Reveals 15 more rows from `localNotifications` and calls `onLoadMore()`. Parent fires `GET /api/notifications` and merges new rows (dedup by id). |
| **Click "Join Group"** | Sets loading spinner. Calls `onAcceptGroupInvite(inviteId, groupId)`. Parent fires `PUT /api/group-invites?id=&group_id=`. Locally sets `inviteStatus[notifId] = "joined"`. |
| **Click "Cancel"/"Decline"** | Sets loading spinner. Calls `onDeclineGroupInvite(inviteId, groupId)`. Parent fires `PUT /api/group-invites?id=&group_id=`. Locally sets `inviteStatus[notifId] = "rejected"`. |
| **Open ⋯ menu → Mark as read/unread** | Local-only state flip. **No API call.** |
| **Open ⋯ menu → Remove** | Optimistic row removal. Calls `onDeleteNotification(id)`. Parent fires `DELETE /api/notifications?id=`. Rolls back on error. |
| **Background refresh** | `App.tsx` polls `GET /api/notifications` every **20s** while a user is logged in. |

